DDEESSCCRRIIPPTTIIOONN
     The ggeennll utility provides user access to generic netlink protocols.

     The following commands are available:

     lliisstt (default)
             Lists all available generic netlink protocols, and presents its
             details:

             operations        Id of the operation if any and associated capa‐
                               bilities

             multicast groups  Id of the available multicast group if any and
                               it associated name

     mmoonniittoorr ⟨family⟩ [multicast group]
             Connect to the _f_a_m_i_l_y protocol and subscribe to the _m_u_l_t_i_c_a_s_t
             _g_r_o_u_p then print the received messages in a readable format if
             the protocol is known.  So far only "nlctrl" and "nlsysevent" are
             known. If no _m_u_l_t_i_c_a_s_t _g_r_o_u_p are provided then all the groups are
             subscribed to.

